{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "112", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Pakistan couldn't have thought of a better way to conclude their tour while England will not be too disappointed after their successful ODI series. This is Pakistan's biggest T20I win in terms of wickets and shows that they have what it takes in the shortest format as well as the longest. Join us next time as we capture the action as it happens in the upcoming matches. Until then, take care and goodbye!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "111", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Man of the Match, WAHAB RIAZ says that he was obviously worried as England are a really destructive team. Also says that they knew if they bowled in the right areas they could get the wickets. Adds that Alex Hales and Jason Roy are very good players and for that reason, they needed to take their chances, which they did today. Further adds that he was observing the new ball and how it moved and the pitch was good for bowling, so that helped. Mentions that the skipper (Sarfraz Ahmed) gives them a lot of confidence and allows them to express themselves out on the field. Ends saying that the tour was a good one for them and that they have learned a lot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "110", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Pakistan captain, SARFRAZ AHMED says that the credit goes to the bowlers and then to Khalid Latif and Sharjeel Khan for playing the way they did. Adds that the bowlers finished things off really well after getting hit for runs in the beginning. Mentions that the plan was to bang in the short balls and get them out via that. Ends by saying that he told the boys to enjoy their game, play without any pressure and with a positive intent.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "109", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "England captain, EOIN MORGAN says the ball skidded through nicely during Pakistan's Powerplay. Adds that Pakistan played nicely and really took the game to them. Mentions that they have done really well over the summer and have been consistent in the performances, and especially credits the bowlers for bowling well on flat pitches. He expresses that he's really happy with his side's progress in both the 50-over format and the T20s and that things are really looking up for them. (When asked about going to Bangladesh) Morgan replies that there's still 5-6 days for him to take a decision on the tour.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "108", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Pakistan did a great job in the first innings to hold the English to a modest total of 135. The hosts got off to a rapid start but Pakistan's bowlers tightened the noose and the flow of runs dried up. Imad Wasim and Hasan Ali were both unplayable but Wahab Riaz was the star of the bowlers with a crucial 3-wicket haul. Other than the openers, none of England's batsmen could get a partnership going.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "107", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The English bowlers were absolutely hapless and ineffective on the night. The pace bowlers were taken for a ride as the ball was flying all around the park. The spinners, Adil Rashid and Moeen Ali were the only ones who could reign them in. They had the most success with Rashid picking up the lone wicket but that was never going to be enough to hold back the carnage.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "106", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The opening pair took apart every bowler that was sent their way and begged for more, with a whopping 15 boundaries and 5 maximums between them in their blistering innings. Sharjeel Khan was dismissed in the 12th over but if ever there was a case of too little, too late, then this was it. Babar Azam came on and sealed the deal for the tourists.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "105", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Pakistan stride off the field like champions and their many supporters shout in rapturous glee. England tried their best and now they can finally slink back after the pasting that their bowlers took. From the word go, Pakistan's openers Sharjeel Khan and Khalid Latif performed at full throttle. Their blistering stroke play was only equaled by the devastation that they wrought to the scoreboard.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.5", "Id": "104", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3732", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "FOUR! THE PERFECT END! Back of a length ball outside off, Azam stays in the crease and punches the ball through the covers and it races across the ropes. That ends the game and Pakistan have absolutely steamrolled the hosts. This has been an absolutely one-sided show as PAKISTAN WIN BY 9 WICKETS AND WITH 31 BALLS TO SPARE!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.4", "Id": "103", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3732", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Another short ball and Azam pulls it through square leg for a brace. Scores are level now.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.3", "Id": "102", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3732", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Short on the stumps, pulled through mid-wicket for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.2", "Id": "101", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3732", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Shortish ball outside off, pulled to mid on for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.1", "Id": "100", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3732", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Short delivery, pulled through the leg side for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "99", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Plunkett is back on.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.6", "Id": "98", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "FOUR! CHOPPED! Short outside off, Babar Azam cuts it through the covers. It finds the gap between the fielders and crosses the ropes. Pakistan have nearly done it and England are going through the motions.", "Summary": {"Score": "130/1", "Over": "14", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "8", "Balls": "8", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "3985", "Runs": "57", "Balls": "40", "Fours": "8", "Sixes": "2"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4661", "Overs": "4", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "29", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.5", "Id": "97", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Flighted full toss, Latif plays it to mid-wicket for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.4", "Id": "96", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Loopy ball outside off, driven to mid on for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.3", "Id": "95", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Shortish ball outside off, punched off the back foot to the covers for a single. only 12 needed now!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.2", "Id": "94", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Flatter ball around off, pushed to point for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.1", "Id": "93", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Loopy ball on middle and off, turning away, pushed to the covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.6", "Id": "92", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "FOUR! He wants to get this over with quickly. Probably has a flight to catch from the looks of it. Short and on the stumps, enough time for Latif go back to this one. From deep within his crease, he murders this through the mid-wicket area and sends it all the way across the boundary line.", "Summary": {"Score": "122/1", "Over": "13", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3985", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "55", "Balls": "37", "Fours": "8", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "59429", "Runs": "2", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4688", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "24", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "91", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Maiden T20I fifty for Khalid Latif!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.5", "Id": "90", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "SIX! WHAT A HIT! Brings up his half century with a biggie. Some flight given to it by Moeen Ali, Khalid Latif skips down the track and slogs it high over the mid-wicket boundary for a biggie. Brilliant batting from him.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.4", "Id": "89", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Latif shimmies down the track to this flighted ball and does well to block it out.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.3", "Id": "88", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Turning in on middle and leg, turned comfortably to the leg side for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.2", "Id": "87", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Short and outside off, Babar stays back and scythes this straight to the man at covers.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.1", "Id": "86", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Googly and shorter outside off, it comes in sharply, Latif opens the face of the bat and runs it down towards short third man for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.6", "Id": "85", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "The batsman rocks onto the backfoot and punches the ball.", "Summary": {"Score": "110/1", "Over": "12", "Runs": "3", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "1", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "3985", "Runs": "44", "Balls": "33", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4661", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "21", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.5", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Didn't quite get to the pitch of the ball but still manages to cream it through the covers for one run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.4", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Floated around the off stump, pushed to covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.3", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "STUMPING CHANCE MISSED! Googly from Rashid on middle and leg, Babar Azam skips down the track and looks to go big but fails to hit the ball. It goes behind to Jos Buttler who fails to collect it. Allows the batsman to get back in time. Not England's evening this.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.2", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Azam works it down the leg side. They pick up a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "BABAR AZAM is the new man in.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.1", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "OUT! CAUGHT! That ends a brilliant innings by Sharjeel! Full outside off, Sharjeel looks to slog it over the leg side. He gets a top edge though and Moeen Ali is able to get underneath that running behind from short cover and take a good two-handed catch. Excellent knock from the opener. He's out, but he's most certainly done the job here for his team.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "53008", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Latif looks to smash it again but edges it onto his pads.", "Summary": {"Score": "107/0", "Over": "11", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3985", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "42", "Balls": "31", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "53008", "Runs": "59", "Balls": "35", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "3"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4688", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Defended off the front foot by the batsman presenting the full face of the bat.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "SIX! Full outside off, Latif goes for an incredible slog sweep that sends the ball soaring over mid-wicket. A youngster in the crowd catches it and jumps up and down in jubilation.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Served around off and spinning in, Latif looks to play it off the front foot but misses. The ball hits his pads and the fielding side appeal for LBW but the umpire doesn't agree.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Played to mid-wicket region by the batsman. One run added to the total.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Full on middle and leg, Latif presents a front foot defense.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Floated outside off, Latif looks to sweep but misses.", "Summary": {"Score": "100/0", "Over": "10", "Runs": "2", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3985", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "36", "Balls": "27", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "53008", "Runs": "58", "Balls": "33", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "3"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4661", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "18", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Tossed up on the pads, nudged to mid-wicket.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Floated outside off, defended off the back foot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Shortish ball on off, punched down the ground. 100 UP FOR PAKISTAN and also a 100-run stand between the openers!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Full outside off, driven through mid on for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Served on middle and leg, worked to mid-wicket.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "The batsman has flicked the ball off his pads. One run added to the total.", "Summary": {"Score": "98/0", "Over": "9", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3985", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "35", "Balls": "22", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "53008", "Runs": "57", "Balls": "32", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "3"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4688", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Outside off, played to point.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Down the leg side, played to mid-wicket for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Flighted outside off, driven hard through the covers for a brace.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Tossed up on middle and leg, Latif looks to sweep it and gets a top edge fine down the leg side for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4688", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Tossed up delivery, defended off the back foot by the batsman.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Moeen Ali to roll his arm.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "2nd T20I fifty for Sharjeel Khan!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "SIX! BANG BANG! That's exactly what's happening here today. What a hit! The Pakistan fans in the stadium are loving what they're seeing here. Fullish in length and attacking the stumps, Sharjeel Khan gets down to this one and slog sweeps his high and mighty over the mid-wicket boundary for half a dozen. Brings up his half century with that as well. And that came really, really quick.", "Summary": {"Score": "93/0", "Over": "8", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "53008", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "54", "Balls": "30", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "3"}, {"Batsman": "3985", "Runs": "33", "Balls": "18", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4661", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Shorter one again, flat again too, it allows Khalid Latif to stay back and eases it down to long on for one run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Shorter and sliding away outside off, cut to covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Googly around leg, it's quite flat as well, glanced down towards fine leg for a couple.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "A slip is in place now...", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "SIX! THAT'S SAILED AWAY INTO THE MANCHESTER SKYLINE! Shorter and flatter on middle and off, Sharjeel rocks back and pulls this with all his might. Clears the mid-wicket fence with ease and sends it sailing into the stands for a maximum.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4661", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Pushed quicker through the air around off, it's pushed in front of covers for nothing.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Seems Sharjeel wants to have a change of bat. The 12th man runs out and brings out a fresh one for him.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Adil Rashid comes into the bowling attack.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10130", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Fuller length ball on the pads, it's flicked on the on side for a run to end the over.", "Summary": {"Score": "77/0", "Over": "7", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "53008", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "39", "Balls": "25", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "3985", "Runs": "32", "Balls": "17", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10130", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "20", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10130", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Excellent delivery, Benjamin! Fires in a perfect yorker, Sharjeel just about manages to get his bat down in time and gets a slight inside edge. He would have been gone otherwise as the ball would have taken the leg pole.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10130", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Length ball aimed at the hips, it's turned square on the leg side for a brisk single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10130", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Banged in short and going way down leg, Khalid Latif lets it be as a wide is signalled.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10130", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Good length ball just outside off, Sharjeel Khan cuts it to deep point for an easy single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10130", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "A little fuller in length and angling across around off, pushed to mid off for no run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10130", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Stokes takes a lot of pace off this one. Keeps it on the shorter side and it hit Sharjeel on the body who goes into the pull shot too early. Latif wants the run but has to hurry back as there is a shy at the bowler's end.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Fuller ball, Latif has driven that ball straight back.", "Summary": {"Score": "73/0", "Over": "6", "Runs": "10", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3985", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "31", "Balls": "16", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "53008", "Runs": "37", "Balls": "20", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10129", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "FOUR! Flatter ball on middle, Latif sweeps it through backward square leg. He finds the gaps and the ball goes to the fence.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "FOUR! It's Root's time to face the beast! Loopy ball down leg, Khalid doesn't let it go, charging down the track to slug it over mid-wicket for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "Shortish ball outside off, punched off the back foot for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Played through mid-wicket by the batsman. They pick up a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10129", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Flatter delivery, defended off the front foot by the batsman presenting the full face of the bat.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Joe Root comes into the attack now.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10130", "Batsman": "53008", "Commentary": "SIX! WHOPPER! Sharjeel Khan has just pulled off the first maximum of the innings! Back of a length ball outside off, Sharjeel waits for it and half pulls it. It doesn't go very high but makes it into the stands.", "Summary": {"Score": "63/0", "Over": "5", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "53008", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "36", "Balls": "19", "Fours": "7", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "3985", "Runs": "22", "Balls": "11", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10130", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10130", "Batsman": "53008", "Comm